We tackled a lot, too.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.500
I'm glad I got to come to this training camp.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.650
Ebumi, you worked hard, too.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:23.010
You're a creep.

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.690
We gave everything we had, didn't we?

00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:25.720
Yeah, I guess.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.920
I gave everything I had.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:29.260
M-Me, too.

